WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
COUNT THE GOLD PASSES. Six shapes. One assignment.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
THE TASK SETS A FILTER. A specific count shapes attention.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
THE VISITOR IS VISIBLE. An unexpected figure crosses the frame.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
SOME NEVER REPORT IT. A report is not a complete inventory.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A SECOND SURPRISE. Knowing one trick does not reveal all.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
READ THE EVIDENCE. Simons & Chabris 1999 · Simons 2010

